# Project Patterns

## CLI (Typer)
- Commands in `cli.py`; use `Annotated` with `typer.Option` / `typer.Argument`
- Read config via `Settings()`; pass through to helpers
- Use `console.print()` for user output (stderr); `typer.echo()` for structured stdout (e.g. dry-run tables)

## Config
- `config.py` loads `.env` and `os.environ`; `Settings` is the single source
- New settings: add to `Settings`, document in `.env.example`, update README

## Subprocess (Marker)
- `marker_runner.run_marker()` wraps `marker_single`; pass `model_path` for HF_HOME
- Use `subprocess.run` with `capture_output=True`, `timeout`, `env` when overriding

## Output & Logging
- Run logs: NDJSON in `data/runs/<run-name>/output.log`
- `ConversionResult` and `RunSummary` in `models.py`; include `worker_id` when parallel
